<p>Aayi haatif ki aawaz sheh ko utro Shabbir ye karbala hai<br />
Bas qadam ab na aage badhaao utro Shabbir ye karbala hai</p>

<p>Ab safar qatm hai ibne Zahra, labe darya karo qaima barpa<br />
Hashr tak hai yahi&rsquo;n tumko rehna utro Shabbir ye karbala hai</p>

<p>Yahi&rsquo;n nau roz mehmaa&rsquo;n rahoge, khaane peene ki eeza sahoge<br />
Bhooke pyaase yahi&rsquo;n qatl honge utro Shabbir ye karbala hai</p>

<p>Marte dam bhi na paani milega, pyaasi gardan pa qanjar chalega<br />
Sar chadega sina pa tumhara utro Shabbir ye karbala hai</p>

<p>Laash chaalees din tak tumhari, Isi jungle me uryaa&rsquo;n rahegi<br />
Rone waala bhi hoga na koi utro Shabbir ye karbala hai</p>

<p>Khaaegi jab sakina tamaacha, yahi&rsquo;n tadpega laasha tumhara<br />
Shimr dega yahi&rsquo;n usko eeza utro Shabbir ye karbala hai</p>

<p>Raahwaar apna sarwar ne roka, utre baaqar wahi&rsquo;n shaahe waala<br />
Haatife ghaib jis dam pukaara utro Shabbir ye karbala hai</p>